:{"commit_sha":"a7d8cd199fd777d441faffe42e783690d0eb43b3","position":"1792648281503365457-467cee71-0122-4430-8bdc-6818e4061df6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed as Gerrit change 3064: commit d7a03c0fee1 on origin/main f5f666702b4, rebased over S4. The only conflicts were the CHANGELOG.md and release-notes.md entries, and both entries are kept. `make verify` on the rebased tree exited 0 (19834 passed, 87 skipped).\n\n72 files changed, all within the declared impact:\n- new `scratch_retention.py` (171 LOC);\n- 9 writer modules now build paths through the helpers;\n- pruning in `persist_phase.persist_and_log`, gated on `persist`;\n- 52 of the 53 test files re-spelled; `test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py` and the `tests/fixtures/` corpora are untouched.\n\n2 choices made during implementation:\n- 5 tests used a local variable named `bridge_state` for the tracker-side `.bridge_state/` directory. It is renamed (`state_dir`, `bindings_file`) so the AC grep over the tests is clean.\n- `test_reconcile_once.py` keeps 1 `\"bridge_state\"` literal on purpose: it is the new check that a live pass writes nothing to the old location.\n\nRatchets: mechanism `new=0 increased=0` from this change; complexity `new=0 increased=0`.","timestamp":1792640090743994649},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Change 3064 merged as 2ece4c6b312. It is patch set 2: patch set 1 lost the CHANGELOG.md entry's closing link line when the rebase conflict was resolved. Patch set 1 was set WIP, and patch set 2 restored the line and passed a full `make verify` (19834 passed, 87 skipped) before it was pushed. Votes on patch set 2: LLM-Review +1, Verified +1.\n\nAC evidence, checked on the merged tree:\n- AC1: the grep over `src/rebar/reconciler`, `scripts` and `.gitignore` prints nothing.\n- AC2: `test_scratch_retention.py` has 10 tests and all pass, including the exact `{\"snapshots\": 4, \"sync_logs\": 2, \"alerts\": 5}` counts.\n- AC3: `reconcile.py:132` names `<tracker>/.bridge_state/prev_snapshot.json`.\n- AC4: `make verify` exited 0 and `make lint` exits 0.\n\nFile impact (20 entries, including `tests/`) covers all 72 files in the merged diff.","timestamp":1792648281503365457}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788807518875429334,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"61b7b719-3908-4166-b0fe-bbb480cd6977","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"4b2a-e417-30ed-4f3a"},{"link_uuid":"a34340c7-c3e1-415f-9719-fabfd7ed4710","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"5e75-b23d-8539-4c5e"},{"link_uuid":"c9a4287a-4515-4f8a-969d-a2b2178add6b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b6e3-91cd-83d4-412f"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nRepo-root scratch (`<repo>/bridge_state/`) is written by `fetcher.py:606,615`, `applier.py:555,664`, `apply_planning.py:341`, `load_phase.py:159,179,183`, `alert_store.py:20-23,100`, `dispatch_one.py:113,168`, `apply_inbound.py:107`, `apply_handlers.py:569`, `invariants.py:351-371`, with prose in `persist_phase.py:162`, `sync_logger.py:8` and `binding_repository.py:9`; it grows unbounded, sits at the repo root (bug `germinable-cosey-vireo` symptom), and `reconcile.py:132` falsely documents the prev snapshot there (it is `<tracker>/.bridge_state/prev_snapshot.json`, `load_phase.py:210-212`). `.gitignore:23` `.rebar/*` ignores everything under `.rebar/` with surgical un-ignores (`:24-`), so `.rebar/bridge/` needs no new pattern and `.gitignore:14` `bridge_state/` becomes dead. `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py` uses the git file list (bug `germinable-cosey-vireo`, closed); only its comment `:28` names `bridge_state/`. Tracker-side `<tracker>/.bridge_state/` (bindings, projects, prev_snapshot, last-pass) is committed state and is not renamed. Cites are on origin/main 754994fd6c5.\n\n## Approach\n1. New `src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py` (~120 LOC): `BRIDGE_SCRATCH_SUBDIR = Path(\".rebar\")/\"bridge\"`, `bridge_scratch_dir(repo_root)`, `snapshots_dir()`, `alerts_dir()`, `sync_log_path(repo_root, pass_id)`, `mapping_path()`, `divergence_state_path()`, constants `RETAIN_SNAPSHOT_PASSES = 5`, `RETAIN_SYNC_LOGS = 5`, `RETAIN_ALERT_DAYS = 30`, and `prune_bridge_scratch(repo_root, *, keep_passes=…, keep_logs=…, keep_alert_days=…) -> dict[str, int]` — best-effort, exception-swallowing (`logger.warning`), mirroring `llm/completion_sidecar.py:46,248-275` (`RETAIN_PER_TICKET`, `prune(keep=…)`): snapshots grouped by pass-id prefix (`<pass>.json`, `<pass>.manifest.json`, stray `<pass>.*.json.tmp`), newest-by-name (pass ids are `%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S`, lexically ordered); `sync-log-*.jsonl` by name; `bridge_alerts/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl` keeps the 30 newest files. `mapping.json` and `comment_id_divergence.json` are cross-pass state and are never pruned.\n2. Every writer module imports these path helpers (`alert_store._STATE_SUBDIR` deleted).\n3. Call `prune_bridge_scratch(ctx.repo_root)` in `persist_phase.persist_and_log` after `sync_logger.close()` (`:251`), guarded by `if persist:`.\n4. Fix `reconcile.py:132`; `docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md:72` row → `<repo_root>/.rebar/bridge/bridge_alerts/*.jsonl`; delete `.gitignore:14`; update the `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:28` comment; fix the prose in `persist_phase.py`, `sync_logger.py` and `binding_repository.py`; add the BREAKING entries to `CHANGELOG.md` and `docs/release-notes.md`. `docs/user-guide.md`, `docs/jira-sync-setup.md` and `docs/concurrency.md` name only the tracker-side `.bridge_state/` (committed state, not renamed), so they need no change.\n5. Tests: the 53 files outside `tests/fixtures/` matched by `git grep -lE '(^|[^._A-Za-z])bridge_state' origin/main -- tests` re-spell the path via the helpers, excluding `tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py` (stays as-is); frozen `tests/fixtures/` corpora are not edited. New `tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py`. No migration of existing `bridge_state/` dirs (scratch; operators delete it).\n\nBREAKING: reconciler scratch moves from `<repo>/bridge_state/` to `<repo>/.rebar/bridge/`; snapshots and sync logs keep the last 5 passes, alerts the last 30 days.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py` (new), the nine writer modules `src/rebar/reconciler/{alert_store,fetcher,applier,apply_planning,load_phase,dispatch_one,apply_inbound,apply_handlers,invariants}.py`, `src/rebar/reconciler/{persist_phase,reconcile,sync_logger,binding_repository}.py`, `.gitignore`, `docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md:72`, `docs/release-notes.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:28`, the tests named above. Out of scope: tracker-side `<tracker>/.bridge_state/` (committed state, not renamed), any new `.gitignore` pattern, and migration of existing scratch dirs.\n\n## Testing\nHappy: `pytest tests/unit/reconciler/state tests/unit/reconciler/fetch tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate -q`; a live-mode `reconcile_once` in a tmp repo writes under `<root>/.rebar/bridge/` and nothing under `<root>/bridge_state/`. Edge (new `tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py`): seed 7 pass ids × (`.json` + `.manifest.json`) + 7 sync logs + 35 alert days → prune leaves 5/5/30 newest and returns `{\"snapshots\": 4, \"sync_logs\": 2, \"alerts\": 5}`; unreadable dir → returns zeros, no raise; a preview pass (`persist=False`) does not prune; `git status --porcelain` after a pass shows no untracked `.rebar/bridge` (covered by `.rebar/*`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `git grep -nE '(^|[^._A-Za-z])bridge_state' -- src/rebar/reconciler scripts .gitignore` is empty — grep (`src/rebar/_engine_support/bridge_fsck_drift.py`'s `bridge_state` is a local variable naming the tracker-side `.bridge_state/`).\n- [x] Retention test passes with the exact counts above — `pytest tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py -q`.\n- [x] `reconcile.py` docstring names `<tracker>/.bridge_state/prev_snapshot.json` — grep.\n- [x] `make verify` exits 0; `make lint` exits 0 in a checkout that has run a live pass (vocabulary guard unaffected).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py","reason":"new: paths + prune"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/applier.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_planning.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/load_phase.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_inbound.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_handlers.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/invariants.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/persist_phase.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/reconcile.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/sync_logger.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/binding_repository.py","reason":"scratch path via helpers"},{"path":".gitignore","reason":"drop dead bridge_state/ line"},{"path":"docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md","reason":"alerts path row"},{"path":"docs/release-notes.md","reason":"BREAKING entry"},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","reason":"BREAKING entry"},{"path":"scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py","reason":"comment"},{"path":"tests/","reason":"path re-spells + new test_scratch_retention.py"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["depends_on","4b2a-e417-30ed-4f3a"],["parent","ebf5-5d21-0124-4313"],["relates_to","5e75-b23d-8539-4c5e"],["relates_to","b6e3-91cd-83d4-412f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"ebf5-5d21-0124-4313","parent_status_uuid":"5a69fed6-36bb-43fb-80e9-ee6cbb2edef1","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_id":"e6ee-ae52-8e5d-4917","ticket_type":"story","title":"Move reconciler scratch from bridge_state/ to .rebar/bridge/ with keep-last-N retention","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6af39c1c-d597-4837-986a-52f2650eccb2","d1ccf66e-90f0-4c65-aaa9-6cb2a7923658","9e77331c-b2b8-4014-8024-34bac31b241a","f8d17a16-7a1a-4356-aa36-1ef8cde843be","f1f279be-a731-48f8-baf1-f1291f2fa777","53ecf7f6-423b-4e45-99b3-6ad5fbdaa4e7","0293cc68-79a2-4565-9f44-7ca377dc5f15","0336316e-8b97-414e-a520-125b36bae8c3","a34340c7-c3e1-415f-9719-fabfd7ed4710","c9a4287a-4515-4f8a-969d-a2b2178add6b","0f5999d3-fbba-4622-9f04-4b3383a2cc47","467cee71-0122-4430-8bdc-6818e4061df6","5a69fed6-36bb-43fb-80e9-ee6cbb2edef1","60663eb5-f97a-451c-8e41-1aab926478c0"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792653614935942001,"uuid":"716aa5d2-3cfd-43c0-b5a3-3d3926d30879"}